[
  {
    "id": "d_dockmaster",
    "speakerNpcId": "n_dockmaster",
    "startNode": "greeting",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "text": "You heading beyond the seawall? The storm left more wreckage than we can count.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Any salvage contracts?",
            "next": "jobs"
          },
          {
            "text": "Tell me about the tides.",
            "next": "tides"
          },
          {
            "text": "My equipment was lost. Can I borrow a basic kit?",
            "next": "loaner",
            "action": {
              "type": "issue_kit"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Goodbye"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "jobs",
        "text": "An empty skiff came home without its crew. Find the mooring tag and come back with it.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "I’ll investigate.",
            "next": "accepted",
            "action": {
              "type": "offer_quest",
              "questId": "q_empty_skiff"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Not today"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "accepted",
        "text": "Good. The West Passage is clear. Don’t count on the lower roads staying dry.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Back"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tides",
        "text": "Low tide opens the lower quays. Rising water closes the cart track. Storm Gate stays reachable inland.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Understood"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "loaner",
        "text": "The harbor cannot replace what you lost. Take a worn arbalest and six bolts—but come back alive this time.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Thank you."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "d_clerk",
    "speakerNpcId": "n_clerk",
    "startNode": "greeting",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "text": "In this harbor we write the lost twice: once at home quay, once in the pilot ledger. The copies disagree.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "What’s missing?",
            "next": "evidence"
          },
          {
            "text": "I have the records.",
            "next": "turnin",
            "action": {
              "type": "turn_in",
              "questId": "q_second_record"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Goodbye"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "evidence",
        "text": "Find the second ledger in the Customs Warehouse. I need the original, not another rumor.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "I’ll retrieve it.",
            "next": "accepted",
            "action": {
              "type": "offer_quest",
              "questId": "q_second_record"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Leave"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "accepted",
        "text": "Bring it back intact. Names matter here.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Back"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "turnin",
        "text": "If these entries are true, someone altered the salvage records after the storm.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "What now?",
            "next": "followup"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "followup",
        "text": "Then the unmarked cargo must be traced.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Investigate the cargo.",
            "next": "accepted",
            "action": {
              "type": "offer_quest",
              "questId": "q_cargo_without_name"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Later"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "d_quartermaster",
    "speakerNpcId": "n_quartermaster",
    "startNode": "greeting",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "text": "Dry rope costs less than a drowned salvager. What supplies do you need?",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Show supplies.",
            "next": "trade",
            "action": {
              "type": "open_shop",
              "shopId": "shop_quartermaster"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Any advice?",
            "next": "tip"
          },
          {
            "text": "Leave"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "trade",
        "text": "Rations, bandages, oil. Count your weight before leaving.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Thanks"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tip",
        "text": "Don’t drag every crate home. Take the things that keep you alive.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Understood"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "d_mechanic",
    "speakerNpcId": "n_mechanic",
    "startNode": "greeting",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "text": "Pressure seals are delicate. A dirty launcher is worse than no launcher.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Inspect weapon parts.",
            "next": "work",
            "action": {
              "type": "open_shop",
              "shopId": "shop_mechanic"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Goodbye"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "work",
        "text": "That fitting came from an experimental batch. I’d test it before trusting it.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Leave"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "d_medic",
    "speakerNpcId": "n_medic",
    "startNode": "greeting",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "text": "The sea strips heat faster than courage. Let me see your wounds.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Purchase treatment.",
            "next": "treat",
            "action": {
              "type": "open_shop",
              "shopId": "shop_medic"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Leave"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "treat",
        "text": "Keep your bandages dry. Salt water is no friend to an open wound.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Thanks"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "d_guard",
    "speakerNpcId": "n_guard",
    "startNode": "greeting",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "text": "Past this gate is Saltwatch proper. Salvagers use the controlled passage to the southeast.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Can I enter the city?",
            "next": "city"
          },
          {
            "text": "Goodbye"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "city",
        "text": "The city is not accessible in this prototype.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Understood"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "d_salvager",
    "speakerNpcId": "n_salvager",
    "startNode": "greeting",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "text": "Wreckers say the Drowned King sank half the missing ships. Too convenient a story.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Tell me more.",
            "next": "king"
          },
          {
            "text": "Leave"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "king",
        "text": "There are false sightings every storm season. Follow the paperwork, not the sea tales.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Investigate the claims.",
            "next": "accepted",
            "action": {
              "type": "offer_quest",
              "questId": "q_false_kings_wake"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Leave"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "accepted",
        "text": "Start with the ruined Watch Store. Someone wanted the records gone.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Thanks"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
